{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25786","headline":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物 · 李绅","name":"寿阳罢郡日有诗十首与追怀不殊今编於後兼纪瑞物","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂阴敢慕甘棠叶，附干将呈瑞木符。\n十步兰茶同秀彩，万年枝叶表皇图。\n芟夷不及知无患，雨露曾沾自不枯。\n好住孤根托桃李，莫令从此混樵苏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}